@api = http://localhost:5080
@salesMock = http://localhost:5101
@serviceMock = http://localhost:5102
@validVin = 1HGCM82633A004352
@emptyVin = WAUZZZ8V1JA003421

### 1. Happy path — both upstreams healthy (200 OK, partial: false, 7 consolidated documents)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/vehicles/{{validVin}}/documents
Accept: application/json

### 2. Valid VIN with Surrounding Whitespace & Lowercase — trimmed & upper-cased (200 OK)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/vehicles/%201hgcm82633a004352%20/documents
Accept: application/json

### 3. Valid VIN with No Documents in Either System — empty list, NOT 404 (200 OK, documents: [])
GET {{api}}/api/v1/vehicles/{{emptyVin}}/documents
Accept: application/json

### 4. Invalid VIN — fails ISO 3779 check-digit or character rules (400 Bad Request, ProblemDetails)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/vehicles/1HGCM82633A0O4352/documents
Accept: application/json

### 5a. Inject Chaos Failure on Service System (503 from Service Mock)
POST {{serviceMock}}/admin/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "fail"
}

### 5b. Partial Failure — Sales healthy + Service down (200 OK, partial: true, Sales docs returned)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/vehicles/{{validVin}}/documents
Accept: application/json

### 6a. Inject Chaos Failure on Sales System Too (both upstreams down)
POST {{salesMock}}/admin/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "fail"
}

### 6b. Both Upstreams Down & No Cache — returns 503 Service Unavailable + Retry-After: 30
GET {{api}}/api/v1/vehicles/{{validVin}}/documents
Accept: application/json

### 7. Reset Both Upstreams Back to Normal
POST {{salesMock}}/admin/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "normal"
}

###
POST {{serviceMock}}/admin/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "normal"
}
